      ],
      "source": "https://www.kentuckytourism.com/things-to-do/culture/history-and-heritage/daniel-boone/boone-trace/livingston"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Livingston is a community steeped in a tradition of country, bluegrass, and spiritual music.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
